Recent review notes
- trustno1-coder added a correctness fix to scan the declared DXBC container
  extent, rather than hashing trailing bytes from its containing executable.
  Ported locally in apps/victory/src/shader.rs with focused extent tests.
- cool_fox's latest commit is Wine-specific SSE2 memcmp compatibility; not
  applicable to this Windows D3D12 target. Other recent changes include
  immutable march UAV lifetime handling; review separately if that path is
  relevant to this title.
- Dolberthi's latest performance commit spans pool sizing, descriptors,
  indirect execution, synchronization, shader lowering and loader hooks;
  not a safe single-change port.
- The placed-copy RT ordering/forwarding path is already present here and
  opt-in. The player's initial A/B report: slightly better, not revolutionary.
- RTX 50 frame generation is not applicable to the RTX 3060. DualSense HID
  is unrelated to rendering.
- fxceless's ray-tracing builder changes span memory tracking and shader paths;
  the current NVIDIA play set keeps that builder path disabled.
